license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/matt-k-wong/espresso_fluid_dynamics_simulation"
abstract: >-
  2D axisymmetric single-phase saturated isothermal Darcy solver with a
  pressure-dependent permeability closure, plus frozen-hydraulic transient
  transport/lumped exchange and a GS3 shot-data comparison baseline.
  Code verification only; transport coefficients illustrative; no measured
  coffee validation. Not a pressure-optimum, flavor, or digital-twin claim.
